 addUserKnob {20 l3_tab l "Layer 3"}
 addUserKnob {6 l3_enable l enable t "Draw this layer. Keep layer 1 the lowest." -STARTLINE}
 addUserKnob {4 l3_type l type t "Sets this layer's shape knobs to the type's values (they can be tuned after)." M {Cumulus "Cumulus Congestus" Stratocumulus Stratus Altocumulus Altostratus Cirrus Cirrocumulus}}
 l3_type Cirrus
